            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.3.0

- Added Draft Groups for organizing drafts in the sidebar.
- Added collapsible Group headers with persistent Group membership.
- Added moving drafts into, out of, and between Groups.
- Added whole-Group drag and reorder with drafts moving together.
- Improved sidebar drag behavior, live displacement, and drop positioning.
]]></description>
